    "implementation_delta": "Publish AccelerateCleanPackage@1. Package discovery includes only ipfs_accelerate_py and scripts, and excludes sibling ipfs_datasets_py / ipfs_kit_py / ipfs_model_manager_py / ipfs_transformers_py trees. MANIFEST.in prunes sibling gitlinks and recursive submodule checkouts from the sdist. Git pins were moved out of the full and all extras into named libp2p, mcp-p2p, ipfs-transformers, and ipfs-model-manager extras; those extras remain source-checkout development extras, not the release profile. Isolated overlay import and a hermetic python -m build wheel+sdist plus pip --no-deps --no-index --target install were observed without sibling trees, sys.path injection, import-time network, or mutable Git-branch release requires. Built artifacts stay in a private temp directory and are not a published PCPR release. Live CPU/CUDA/model/provider compute remains typed unavailable. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
